[{"client_msg_id":"e693f1db-6757-4e8c-89e4-73204b6791c9","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"長いと、鍵をトークンにぶっ込む時に計算量が多くなるからPCだけなら困らないのかも。usb突っ込んで使ってないなら","ts":"1625582159.343500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"15m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f03eea5-d25c-46f6-89f2-bef3de50ef94","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"2048が4096になろうと2^11が2^12になるだけなんで、log m は 12/11 倍。最初が2048程度あれば、大した増加とはなりません。\n下位の項の影響もあるだろうし、ほぼ4倍ぐらいの感覚で良いと思います。","ts":"1625571451.339600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iB96K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1334ce04-dbbc-4332-ae58-5de9b18e9b98","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"みんなが ed25519 って言ってるからそれでヨシ :yoshi: みたいな決め方しかできない","ts":"1625571446.339400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01HXNSLCH5","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVop"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d36c8e6-22dc-4451-a43e-96094265f3cd","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、そうか、厳密な話する必要ないし 4倍ちょっと、で十分ですね","ts":"1625571225.337500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nPEPN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b18fb33-532e-4eb1-bf5d-e6ac5ca56f6c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"雑に言うなら、鍵長が2倍になれば計算量は4倍ちょいになる、って感じですかねー","ts":"1625570039.335800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZkI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4294d876-1b08-4b63-93bd-bf5bca28a82e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"えーとこっから雑な比較計算したいけど、どう整理したもんか","ts":"1625569839.335200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=7Qy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34515933-e58f-49e0-92b6-f38f82756bd5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"O(4m^2 + 4m^2 log m)になるよね、多分","ts":"1625569664.333400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AkhW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"256461bb-a217-410b-b5f9-7828169f0270","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"つまり倍になると 4m^2 が加算される?\n計算あってるかな...","ts":"1625569594.331900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZCu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ea8e17a-8919-415b-bad0-35f393761ecd","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"m が鍵長で、その暗号化と復号にかかる計算量","ts":"1625569232.327400","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1625569294.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59585887-5ae5-4915-a7b1-2e57cd0b57b3","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"適当にググったら O(m^2 log m) って出てきました","ts":"1625569195.326300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+om"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed1ac8f3-2269-41da-bc29-e3b0a7dfece5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"RSAの鍵長の推奨はそこから出てるはずなので、推奨から逆算すれば出そうではありますが。。","ts":"1625569176.325700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j06aE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5414bb7b-1539-4fa2-abf6-6acf30c5ae5c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"うーん？どうなんでしょう。","ts":"1625569134.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GR5ZE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aec3b28-342f-4cca-95ff-220b652f5b8b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"そういや、RSAの鍵長に対しての計算量の増加ってどれくらいのオーダなんでしょうね","ts":"1625569024.324300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=D8w6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c28a7c4-48bb-4de7-b1e9-3f2f1e83cd4e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最新に近いですね、まあそこまでパラメータにバリエーション多いわけじゃないし、そうなるか...\nまあやっぱりEd25519でいいかな感ありますな","ts":"1625568993.323400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EsvtF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4310cb57-c551-4e56-9118-ec330393e403","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。鍵を変える機運が高まったらどんどん変えていかないと。\nいつでも変えれるようにしておくのは大事かもしれませんね。","ts":"1625568748.318900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=gqs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b892973-3e53-4e4f-933b-30962dd5c98a","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"都度、最善を追うしかないですねー。","ts":"1625568747.318800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xSG14"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0068c77b-8af6-4e1c-8da5-f8122903a9ef","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"とはいえ楕円曲線暗号の実装も10年後には RSA と同じ批判にさらされてそうみたいな気もしますけどw // これはただの実装何も知らずに言ってる無責任な予想","ts":"1625568669.317200","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1625568732.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dMuP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a91d7418-978a-4e4a-9d53-430a744f1e4e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、実装の質の問題は確かに考慮するのはよさそうですね\nもしかしたら致命的なやつがどーんって出てきていきなり死ぬみたいなことがあるかもしれないですねw \u0026gt; RSA","ts":"1625568594.315300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+=QyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d90bc258-3a63-41ef-8854-e681595df450","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"最新だと ed448 もあるんだろうか","ts":"1625568315.311000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0y/MF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"251e67eb-32ea-451f-89d3-81be1e0ab872","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"manjaroとはいえ更新が遅い気も。。？なんで降ってこないんだろ","ts":"1625568238.309300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CoaIE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"549d0bff-b8e5-4219-95e9-58fbed65e961","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://gnupg.org/download/index.html\u003e\n2.2.29がLTSで最新は2.3.1なんですね。\n関係ないですが、私の手元でも2.2.27でした。","ts":"1625568144.308800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LZ4qj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"467d50d4-c027-453c-b1e6-0c84ebaca971","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Release Noteが更新されてない。。\n\u003chttps://gnupg.org/download/release_notes.html\u003e","ts":"1625568093.308600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9av"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f81de920-1bf2-4fde-bba4-fe0a5e8f9c62","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"2.2.27 です \u0026gt; gpg","ts":"1625568024.308000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XW99"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5677b0d4-9be9-44cf-88ce-92ea9f22fa8e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"単純に暗号を破るのにかかる時間とは別に、潜在的な脆弱性の観点からEd25519ってことみたいね。\n\n• ECDSA: 疑似乱数使ってるから予測可能になるとオワル\n• RSA: 散々脆弱性が見つかってきてて、どのコンポーネントがやばいかわからん\n• Ed25519: 疑似乱数使ってないし効率的だしオススメ\n\u0026gt; Practical Cryptography With Go \u003chttps://leanpub.com/gocrypto/read#leanpub-auto-ed25519\u003e","ts":"1625567993.307300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IbG="}]},{"client_msg_id":"060a0cd7-4cbc-4775-94b4-09828520b120","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"んー、バージョンいくつなんです?","ts":"1625567873.306100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YGraN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bc7f994-c8ea-416b-977f-70bea52009c1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"今手元の gpg が微妙で curve25519 と NIST curve (とあとも一個あった気がするけど忘れた) って選択肢しかなくて\nセキュリティ強度の高いがバックドアの可能性を報道された NIST curve か、ちょっと低いけど現時点そういう話のでていない curve25519 かみたいな感じなんですよねぇ...","ts":"1625567643.304100","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1625567661.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YlH=R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f00dc5f1-eb67-4748-b5ed-aeaf0bd5df92","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"SipHashも作ったんだっけか\n\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SipHash\u003e\n(プログラミング言語が連想配列つくるときに使うDDoS耐性のあるハッシュ関数)","ts":"1625567517.301000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rN9zd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ada2c8e8-797a-4f85-838b-6386d6dfb674","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Google推進で ChaCha20-Poly1305がAESと並ぶレベルになったり、なんだかんだ凄い人","ts":"1625567450.298600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lfgn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9c60a3d-e68c-429b-a781-aa63d8b1915d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%80%E3%83%8B%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3\u003e\ndjbへの信頼w?","ts":"1625567400.296900","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: ダニエル・バーンスタイン","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"ダニエル・バーンスタイン","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%80%E3%83%8B%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3","text":"ダニエル・ジュリアス・バーンスタイン（英語: Daniel Julius Bernstein, 1971年10月29日 - ）は、イリノイ大学シカゴ校の数学及び暗号学教授で、qmailやdjbdnsなどのネットワーク基幹ソフトウェアの開発者でもある。djbとも呼ばれる。\nこれまでに作成したソフトウェアは、当初、コンパイル済みでのバイナリでの再配布は一部条件下でのみ許可をしていた。2007年冬、作成したソフトウェアの大半をパブリックドメインとしている。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1a/Dan_Bernstein_27C3.jpg/1200px-Dan_Bernstein_27C3.jpg","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%80%E3%83%8B%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%80%E3%83%8B%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"deU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8e474da-415a-4f0a-b9ab-a42d70f8e75a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"セキュリティ強度の比較と今推奨される最低限のセキュリティ強度さえ見てればとりあえずはよさそうだと思ってます","ts":"1625567372.296300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i=KO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef407765-fd98-4c2f-a4bd-dcd102175320","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"NIST推奨パラメータを使ってませんからね \u0026gt; ed25519\n他の楕円曲線はよくあるパラメータのいくつかはNISTと絡みがあるのでちょっと忌避されたところがある(のでed25519が伸びた)","ts":"1625567365.296100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/UfO+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf034b05-8572-478e-bb18-b52eab9b4349","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ脆弱性がみつかるんでない限りはed25519が悪いってことはないと思うので、それでいいかと思います。","ts":"1625567315.293900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":3,"users":["UG6DF6W87","UDPT2BZ6E","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h5F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f357b13e-6369-4833-90a2-bcc4568d0ff5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"P-512 って楕円曲線を使ったやつならありますが、NIST に首根っこ掴まれてる可能性を許容できればどうぞ、みたいな政治っぽい話もあるようで、どれを選べばいいかから難しいですからね...","ts":"1625567296.293500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GWSU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"848a6bea-118b-410e-91ff-68f191144c73","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"とりあえずed25519はいいぞと言われるからed25519に全部変えたけど、ed25519のアルゴリズムを知ってるわけではない。。\nただ、暗号関連については専門家の言うことに単に従う方がいいのかなとも思ってます。","ts":"1625567274.292600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Lk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b54a9dbf-e9c7-4ad4-9cae-396f7c9f2714","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"ed448 とか私手元の gpg だと対応してないですからねー","ts":"1625567165.289800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ae"}]},{"client_msg_id":"046996ca-b476-4b04-9799-43e8132cb422","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"我々は雰囲気で(ry","ts":"1625567137.288900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fIk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c38ad752-ba68-4c00-84e6-836eaa5b1b08","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"楕円曲線暗号は短い鍵でそれなりな強度が得れるというとこがメリットだと私は思ってますが、正しいかは知らない","ts":"1625567118.288500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j3wL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b40b4711-f427-4e74-9fa8-454d56695bf5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"だいたい長くても2030っぽいですね\nまあ変えたければどうぞくらいじゃないでしょうか\nRSA4048なら多少放置してても良さそうだし、対応サービスも多そう","ts":"1625567067.286900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48e57553-a97f-4ee4-9187-5fcd66269657","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"解説としてはここをみつつ、表を最新の参照するのがいいかな?","ts":"1625566979.285400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bprq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b71f64a-8d9b-4049-8f9e-421d386f2e7b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://text.baldanders.info/remark/2017/10/key-parameters/\u003e\nちょっと古いんですが、強度としてはセキュリティ強度112 = RSA 2048で2030まで、くらいっぽい","ts":"1625566954.284400","attachments":[{"fallback":"暗号鍵関連の各種変数について","id":1,"title":"暗号鍵関連の各種変数について","title_link":"https://text.baldanders.info/remark/2017/10/key-parameters/","text":"この記事は将来の記事で再利用するための snippet 置き場として使うことにする。","thumb_url":"https://text.baldanders.info/images/attention/remark.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"text.baldanders.info","service_icon":"https://text.baldanders.info/favicon.ico","thumb_width":500,"thumb_height":467,"from_url":"https://text.baldanders.info/remark/2017/10/key-parameters/","original_url":"https://text.baldanders.info/remark/2017/10/key-parameters/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"37g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f78473df-4899-444d-9cb7-07f46a8ea523","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"RSA 8192を入れたら2087とか2100年とか出て笑いました。頑丈すぎる","ts":"1625566938.283700","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625566952.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5uoA"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"RSA 2048の評価はそれぞれの機関で異なってますが、そろそろ換え時ではあるかもしれません。","ts":"1625566759.282400","thread_ts":"1625566759.282400","reply_count":1,"files":[{"id":"F026ZBMK1RU","created":1625566755,"timestamp":1625566755,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":81677,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T0