ich_text","block_id":"IN+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0662064d-ea4c-4b37-8060-2ce522b41ffe","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"cho さんの貼った記事のコメント欄に\n\u0026gt; RSA 3072bitとED25519(256bit)は大体同等の強度とされています。\nとあるけど、本当だろうか。ed25519 より RSA 4096 の方が強い?","ts":"1625566128.269400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kNV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d96fac86-b2c7-468a-a298-3f1f0e071d1c","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"256 のところをクリックすると、各方式の比較ができますね。2030 \u0026amp; beyond ってなってるのもあるから、もうちょっといけるのかも。","ts":"1625566128.269300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vTS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbb2c0dc-9170-4831-913f-9f18d984cc7f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"2030年からは -t ecdsa にして鍵長を指定しないといけなくなる？","ts":"1625565990.267700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db0673a0-fe8f-4622-a423-87a276a3a016","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"上の表だとed25519は2030年くらいまで使えるっぽいですね","ts":"1625565931.267500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7za4m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dadc73ba-57ae-4adc-8fba-acdc2f4962c1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"機関でもないのか。Method だし。検証方法?","ts":"1625565898.267200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w+ntH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82ba2a5d-1ded-4c71-aa88-c78788836ff5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど、各暗号化方式について、様々な機関が検証した結果の表、ということなのかな","ts":"1625565868.266500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iDEti"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5d20432-8320-4499-8bf4-c210a7652e6f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"シャでは仕事のマニュアルをEd25519指定にしてあげたので、よくわかってない人も自動でEd25519使ってる","ts":"1625565720.265400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"banjaku","count":3,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OiZqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8568fbca-5a92-4524-b802-dbc632ab90ac","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"無知を晒してしまった。鍵長変えるとアルゴリズム変わるんですね。","ts":"1625565713.265200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YzXOQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"526a80c4-4a6a-456f-a67b-04fcb946c614","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だっけ?","ts":"1625565710.264900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U4Qb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"574714f1-6fe2-4718-8437-b191ebe210d6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"アルゴリズム的に鍵長固定","ts":"1625565704.264700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/6FCH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faf3fd48-21a2-49af-9c88-745e9da8b68e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね\n\u003chttps://sig9.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/11/000000\u003e","ts":"1625565689.264100","attachments":[{"fallback":"らくがきちょう: SSH は (RSA 鍵より) ED25519 鍵の方が強固で速い - らくがきちょう","id":1,"title":"SSH は (RSA 鍵より) ED25519 鍵の方が強固で速い - らくがきちょう","title_link":"https://sig9.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/11/000000","text":"SSH 用の鍵を作成する際、従来は RSA を利用するケースがとても多かったと思います。 ですが、ED25519 の方が RSA よりも強度が高く、しかも速いです。 ED25519 に対応していない古い SSH の実装が無い限り、今後は ED25519 を利用した方が良さそうです。 今回は ED25519 の鍵ペアを作成する方法をメモしておきます。 尚、ED25519 は OpenSSH 6.5 以降でサポートされています。","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/8454420450077954260/26006613490399962/1614417045","blocks":null,"ts":1578668400,"service_name":"らくがきちょう","service_icon":"https://sig9.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://sig9.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/11/000000","original_url":"https://sig9.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/01/11/000000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02bcdd36-7a1e-4dea-9053-f6e34fc5f08c","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"Ed25519 は固定で 256 ですね。Discrete Logarithm かな。","ts":"1625565679.263600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CVC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"452157ec-565f-4dc4-991c-a106e30bdcd7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"RSAのときは鍵長を覚えていたのですがEd25519にしてから鍵長を覚えてない。。\nEd25519だからといっていつまでたっても同じ鍵長はダメだろうと思うので今の鍵長を覚えておかないと。","ts":"1625565558.262600","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1625565573.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KHh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4533f4e9-7a8f-4c0f-83e1-66fd7090d6e6","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"評価の方法、ってことなのかな。どの機関の何年の方式、みたいな。","ts":"1625565496.262400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rf5s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"996dacbf-04e7-437f-a1a0-8ccef0cb4065","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"methodといいつつ、各セキュリティグループ名があるのはどうなんだろうね...","ts":"1625565250.261500","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1625565260.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5co"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3dc2547-4fd8-4ba8-afe3-a7c2ba6bf8d8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"表の見方が全然わからないw","ts":"1625565069.260400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9LB9j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23df5701-625d-4c1b-b715-f8ffee4b3497","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Method が鍵の方式ではない…?","ts":"1625565061.260200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H4xWv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca93b2f0-af61-4064-aa0c-119c13cb085c","type":"messa