sage","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分はマシンパワーはあるのでRSAなら4096にしてた気が\n基本はEd15519だけど、ソフトやサービスの都合常に使えるとは限らないからなあ...","ts":"1625563550.250300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y3dK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f3c7023-232d-43c3-b093-b46a887b12d4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"RSA 使ってたときは 8192 使ってました","ts":"1625562889.249500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GDp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95eee256-1682-47b8-aebd-5d39622e1252","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私はもう ed15519 に移行してしまったのでもうわからない","ts":"1625562878.249200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZWlvB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58ebc8f4-122e-4c33-ab69-fefc8b6f449b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"GitHubの鍵はEd25519にしてる","ts":"1625562874.249100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"il2N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"593e74f2-bd60-46cb-9122-616dd028fce3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"github に 2048 の鍵を使ってる人を見かけたので、これってセーフな長さだっけ…と少し心配になったんですが取り越し苦労でした","ts":"1625562849.248300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ySRxa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db931a31-672f-4394-8ae9-b33e583447e6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"2048 はセーフラインか。ありがとうございます","ts":"1625562801.247700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QufN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fef3473e-bb78-42c0-b48d-355b9116b07e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u0026gt; 2004年現在、インターネットで公募した数多くのPCを用いると512ビット程度の数なら素因数分解できる。 したがって、現在では、RSA暗号に使用する法 n を1024-4096ビット（10進数で300-1000桁程度）にすることが推奨されている。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; しかしShamirは、RSA問題を解くための専用装置 (TWIRL) を作成すれば、1024ビットの n に関するRSA問題ですら解くことができると主張している。","ts":"1625562759.247400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xVSvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aaf87509-8317-4fd8-a959-4e1f2e152f5e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"2048 以上が必須じゃないですかね","ts":"1625562741.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G2hn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c55c8540-6942-408c-967c-15d50db0a47d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA%E6%9A%97%E5%8F%B7|https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA%E6%9A%97%E5%8F%B7\u003e","ts":"1625562740.247000","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: RSA暗号","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"RSA暗号","title_link":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA%E6%9A%97%E5%8F%B7","text":"RSA暗号（RSAあんごう）とは、桁数が大きい合成数の素因数分解問題が困難であることを安全性の根拠とした公開鍵暗号の一つである。\n暗号とデジタル署名を実現できる方式として最初に公開されたものである。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA%E6%9A%97%E5%8F%B7","original_url":"https://ja.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/RSA%E6%9A%97%E5%8F%B7"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EM0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e74c1a6-f251-49b0-a08c-bcb9dc7b06e4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ssh で使う RSA の鍵の長さって今だと最低どれくらいあった方がいいんですっけ","ts":"1625562665.246600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oga7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98253d6a-1ca5-48ca-83d9-0dbba1893ac4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"リンク \u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CTHMGMNNS/p1625564189254900\u003e","ts":"1625566913.283000","thread_ts":"1625566759.282400","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 6th, 2021 2:36 AM] addokoda: 鍵の長さの各機関の推奨値は、\u003chttps://